## Original Content
<p>Mike George, who once led the company when it was Qurate Retail Group, has been named interim chief executive officer.</p>

## Summary
QVC Group has emerged from Chapter 11 bankruptcy protection, and its CEO has stepped down. Mike George, who previously led the company when it was known as Qurate Retail Group, has been appointed as interim CEO to guide the company through this transition.

## Key Points
- QVC Group has successfully exited Chapter 11 bankruptcy.
- The company's CEO has resigned from the position.
- Mike George, former leader of Qurate Retail Group, is now interim CEO of QVC Group.


